Package: sg200x-camera-dkms
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: dkms
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: camera drivers for Sophgo SG200x boards (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree V4L2 drivers for the SG200x video input (raw capture) and MIPI
 CSI-2 receiver, the Sony IMX708 sensor and the DW9817 focus driver of the
 Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3, with a device tree overlay for the Milk-V
 Duo S J2 connector. Nothing is enabled until the overlay is.
